From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:39:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1732/3799] soh: rename func_808B44CC -> BgSpot15Rrbox_Stuck

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: refuses every push, cancelling the player's dyna-poly move each frame.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Rrbox/z_bg_spot15_rrbox.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Rrbox/z_bg_spot15_rrbox.c         | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Rrbox/z_bg_spot15_rrbox.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Rrbox/z_bg_spot15_rrbox.c
index b91532fb8..e5b577887 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Rrbox/z_bg_spot15_rrbox.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot15_Rrbox/z_bg_spot15_rrbox.c
@@ -28,7 +28,8 @@ void BgSpot15Rrbox_Fall(BgSpot15Rrbox* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_808B
 void BgSpot15Rrbox_SetupStuck(BgSpot15Rrbox* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_808B44B8 [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808B4178: installs the sliding action and turns gravity off for the slide.
 void BgSpot15Rrbox_SetupSlide(BgSpot15Rrbox* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_808B4178 [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_808B44CC(BgSpot15Rrbox* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808B44CC: refuses every push, cancelling the player's dyna-poly move each frame.
+void BgSpot15Rrbox_Stuck(BgSpot15Rrbox* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_808B44CC [LLM:HIGH]
 
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_808B4590: which entry of sSpawnPositions the next crate takes; it is bumped on each spawn and reset when the scene reloads.
 static s16 sNextSpawnIndex = 0;  // was D_808B4590 [LLM:HIGH]
@@ -355,10 +356,10 @@ void BgSpot15Rrbox_Fall(BgSpot15Rrbox* this, PlayState* play) {
 }
 
 void BgSpot15Rrbox_SetupStuck(BgSpot15Rrbox* this, PlayState* play) {
-    this->actionFunc = func_808B44CC;
+    this->actionFunc = BgSpot15Rrbox_Stuck;  // was func_808B44CC [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
-void func_808B44CC(BgSpot15Rrbox* this, PlayState* play) {
+void BgSpot15Rrbox_Stuck(BgSpot15Rrbox* this, PlayState* play) {
     Player* player = GET_PLAYER(play);
 
     player->stateFlags2 &= ~PLAYER_STATE2_MOVING_DYNAPOLY;
